WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:03.740
<i>The Duel Carnival Tournament Finals have begun at last!</i>

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:05.350
<i>The Duel Coasters!</i>

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:08.650
<i>This is my first time Dueling on a roller coaster!</i>

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:10.150
<i>It's so fun!</i>

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:11.530
<i>Wait, what?</i>

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:12.860
<i>Who the heck're these guys?</i>

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.660
<i>They're aiming for me in a three-on-one match?</i>

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:17.370
<i>But I won't lose!</i>

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.610
<i>I'm gonna bring it to 'em!</i>

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.800
<i>They went and Summoned Monsters!</i>

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.710
<i>That means they plan to make this three-on-one!</i>

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:33.170
<i>It's suddenly become a three-on-one battle.</i>

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:39.180
<i>Whoa! Waiting to pursue Contestant Tsukumo at the high end was none other than</i>

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:45.190
<i>the Fallguys, who made it through the preliminaries using their exceptional team plays as a weapon!</i>

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:47.740
<i>And they have already Summoned Monsters!</i>

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:51.490
<i>Now then, don't miss a second of this Duel that's about to begin!</i>

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:54.610
<i>Heart Burning!</i>

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:56.660
Don't lose, Yuma!

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:58.070
Bring it to 'em!

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:01.160
I can't wait.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:05.540
How will those prize hunters deal with Yuma?

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:11.840
<i>We just need to crush this Yuma Tsukumo brat?</i>

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:14.800
<i>That is the only way you people will receive the reward you desire.</i>

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:17.930
<i>I like the sound of that.</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:19.260
<i>It's settled, Big Bro.</i>

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:26.020
<i>We'll settle on those agreements. We'll crush him as you wish. You can count on us.</i>

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:29.610
But it isn't fun if you simply crush him.

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:32.140
I want to see it.

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:34.490
Yuma Tsukumo's strength.

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:41.920
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:47.260
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:02:00.110 --> 00:02:04.110
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:09.910
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:14.500
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:20.540
<i>It's too late for us to turn back now</i>

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:25.630
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:31.180
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:02:31.970 --> 00:02:36.980
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:42.020
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:47.490
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:53.160
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:59.330
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:05.420
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:19.050
"Number 52:
 The Duel Coasters Vs the Rampaging Train!!"

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:18.760
Take this!

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:29.680
Shit! They're enemies standing in our way!
 We've got no choice but to fight them!

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:32.560
I Summon Gagaga Kaiser!

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:40.610
Gagaga Kaiser! Attack the Saucer in the front!

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.750
Yes! You did it!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.540
Wait, Yuma. Now isn't the time to be celebrating.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:59.010
Look at their Monsters.

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:04.390
Their Attack Points went up?!

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:05.890
Wh-Why?

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:11.890
This is the effect of the Magnet Monsters we Fallguys control.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:16.650
When an ally Monster with "Magnet" in their name is destroyed in battle,

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:21.070
it increases the Attack Power of the remaining Monsters by 400 points.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.950
The real battle begins now!

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:29.910
Saucer! Attack Gagaga Kaiser!

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:36.830
They killed each other?!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:37.960
But this is...

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:41.380
My Eagle's Attack Power rises to 2000!

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:43.670
Go on! Direct Attack!

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:51.220
That brings the first battle to a close.

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:54.890
The Attack Points that were increased will now return to normal.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.360
Huh? They got hit fair-and-square.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.900
You're stronger than <i>this</i>, aren't you?

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:05.950
Hurry and show me your strength!

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.200
I have no business with those not holding Numbers!

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:10.910
Get lost!

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.040
Go! Reverse Buster!

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:14.790
Direct Attack!

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:27.680
Tron! V! I swear I'll kill the both of you!

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:31.140
Kaito...

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:33.890
Don't overdo it...

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:39.310
<i>This way and that way, fierce battles are beginning to unfold!</i>

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:43.280
<i>But the hottest of them all, as I thought,</i>

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:44.780
<i>is over there!</i>

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:48.280
<i>Contestant Tsukumo and the Fallguys!</i>

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:52.450
<i>Will Contestant Tsukumo fall victim to them as one would expect?!</i>

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:57.460
<i>Get fired up! Heart Burning!</i>

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.920
I play Magnet Kong Epsilon!

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.630
Magnet Crocodile Zeta!

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:05.130
- Summon!
 - Summon!

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:15.560
Now we've been surrounded by Monsters again!

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.480
Even if I battle them like this...

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:21.310
It will only increase the Attack Power of the remaining Monsters.

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:23.020
What should I do?

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:25.990
Yuma, use Gogogo Golem from your hand.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:26.360
Huh?

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:32.070
Gogogo Golem won't be destroyed in battle once per turn when it's in Defense Mode.

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:37.790
That's it! If I'm able to evade their attacks and use that time to change our lane...

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:42.250
I Summon Gogogo Golem!

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:50.050
Now! The second battle begins!

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:53.550
Crocodile Zeta, attack Gogogo Golem!

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:55.180
Croc Attack!!

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.770
Nice one, Gogogo Golem!

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:02.980
Epsilon, attack Gogogo Golem!

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.360
Kong Punch!!

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:09.650
Now! Change our lane before we get hit by the third attack!

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:10.450
Right!

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:15.620
We already saw through that trick!

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:17.620
Go on, Coyote!

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:20.500
There!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.750
What?! The lane's been closed off!

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:27.380
So this is the Fallguys' team play...

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.840
He's only got 1000 Life Points left.

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:33.890
My Eagle Delta has 1200 Attack Points.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:35.760
If this Direct Attack goes through...

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:38.140
We'll have carried out our agreement with Tron.

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:39.930
Then we'll get our hands on a ton of cash!

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:41.020
Yuma!

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:44.610
Darn! What should we do?

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:48.730
This ends it!

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:52.490
Go, Magnet Eagle Delta! Attack Yuma direct-

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:56.280
What!?

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:04.830
Who the hell is this guy?!

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.040
Wh-Who in the world are you!?

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:10.130
Three-on-one is such cowardly behavior!

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:14.050
I came to assist you, Yuma!

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:15.720
Y-You!?

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:16.760
Anna!?

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.940
What are you doing here?!

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:28.400
Save the explanation for later!
 For now, let's crush these guys!

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.860
Go, Rocket Arrow!

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:33.320
It's got 5000 Attack Points!?

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.200
Big Bro, let me!

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.880
You saved us, Anna!

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:56.890
But I thought you weren't participating in the Duel Carnival!

00:08:56.890 --> 00:09:00.350
Don't worry about the minor details. You're a man, aren't you?

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:01.930
You didn't...

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.020
What the?!

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.150
No one even attacked it!

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:12.400
If you don't send five cards from your hand to the Graveyard

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:15.860
after Rocket Arrow battles, it blows itself up.

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.570
You forget something really important!

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:22.540
Well, I told you not to worry about the minor details!

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:25.750
Tch, what're you standing around chatting for?!

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:29.920
I activate the Magic Card, Magnet Reborn, from my hand!

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:35.800
I pay 500 of my Life to bring back Crocodile Zeta from my Graveyard!

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:39.180
Go! Crocodile Zeta!

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.390
Get out of there, Anna!

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:52.480
What an annoying girl! I'll crush you first!

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:57.950
Anna! It's a Draw Lane! Go on and draw!

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:58.860
Draw!

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:03.240
I Summon Courageous Locomotive Brave Pappo!

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:12.800
I activate the Magic Card, Magnet Fusion, from my hand!

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:22.600
I release Eagle Delta, Crocodile Zeta, and King Eplison!

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:27.020
Show yourself! Super Electromagnetic Dragon - Magnedragon!

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:30.480
3500 Attack Points!?

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:32.020
Yuma! Anna is...

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:34.980
Yeah! Now it's <i>my</i> turn to save <i>her</i>!

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:36.860
I draw!

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:40.070
I Summon Bull Blader!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.660
Just wait, Anna! I'm gonna change our lane!

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:49.460
Yuma, in front of you!

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:50.460
What!?

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:52.710
I won't let you change your lane!

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.460
Calm down. There's got to be another crossroad.

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:59.380
You won't make it! Draw!

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.390
I Summon Magnet Pandoll!

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:11.310
Draw! I Summon Magnet Jammer!

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:18.070
Magnedragon, attack Brave Poppo!

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:19.950
Magne Inferno!!

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:25.330
When Magnedragon destroys a Monster...

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:29.790
the opponent takes damage equal to its Attack Power!

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.630
Anna!

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:41.590
Yuma! If this keeps up, Anna will...

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:47.140
But we're blocked from the front and the back.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:49.810
Since it's come to this, we'll just have to force a path open!

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:52.520
Go, Bull Blader!

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.480
Attack Pandoll!

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:02.530
But I use this timing to activate Pandoll's effect!

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:06.580
The moment it's destroyed, it inflicts 200 points of damage on my opponent!

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:14.790
Then I activate the Magic Card, Magnet Reborn, from my hand!

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:19.630
I pay 500 of my Life Points to return Pandoll from the Graveyard!

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:26.350
Come at me as many times as you want.
 I'll cut down your Life point by point!

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:30.390
If you keep doing that over and over, your Life will drop to zero...

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:32.140
I'm fine with that.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.810
We're a team.

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:39.690
Even if you deplete mine or Jackal's Life, as long as Brother Wolf has some left...

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:42.820
I'll crush you and we'll be rolling in dough!

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:44.030
Dough?!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.530
What in the world are they talking about?

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:49.660
We aren't after the championship.

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:50.870
We want money!

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:53.460
We entered a contract stating we have to crush you in order to get the money!

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:54.870
N-No way!

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:57.170
Crush me? Who would do something like that?

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:58.290
Beats me.

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:02.720
Draw!

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:07.930
<i>In my current situation, this guy's the only one I can Summon. It can't be helped!</i>

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:13.060
Strongarm Express Trolleyrolley, please protect me!

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:17.520
1000 Defense Points?

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:21.190
That won't protect you from my Magnedragon!

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:26.360
Go, Bull Blader! Attack Pandoll!

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.330
It's useless to struggle!

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.290
You won't ever be able to pull down our formation.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:43.630
Your friend will be finished off by Brother Wolf!

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:48.340
I gotta do something! If this keeps up, Anna will...!

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:50.640
But in this situation...

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.020
The finishing blow!

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:55.770
Anna!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.230
I'm not liking your mood, Yuma!

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:04.230
I use Heroic Challenger - Spartas to attack Magnet Jammer!

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.150
Gauche!

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:06.110
What the?!

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:10.200
Oh crap! I activate Magnet Jammer's Monster Effect!

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:12.490
It returns both our Monsters to our hands!

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.540
Impudent mood-killer...

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:20.540
Hey, Yuma! I'll take this guy off your hands!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:23.000
Thanks a bunch! I'm in your debt!

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.590
I'll return my debt from before, Anna!

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:29.090
Yuma!

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:30.430
Anna!

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.060
Go, Bull Blader!

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:36.230
You fool!

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:38.480
Do you really think your 1600 Attack Power Bull Blader

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:42.270
can beat my 3500 Attack Power Magnedragon?!

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:43.360
We'll see!

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:48.860
Bull Blader can negate battle damage and destroy the opponent's Monster!

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:50.110
What did you say?!

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:58.210
You didn't need to do that! I wouldn't get damaged by a guy like him!

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:01.170
Gosh! After you went out of your way to save her!

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:03.380
I'm the one who saved you before!

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:06.760
Yeah! Thanks a lot, Anna.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:10.840
Huh? It's not like you need to praise me or anything...

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:12.430
You look really pleased to me!

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.760
How dare they mock me...!

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:17.060
I'll crush Yuma Tsukumo!

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:20.560
I'll start by negating Bull Blader's Monster Effect!

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.190
Use our Final Formation!

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.230
- Roger!
 - Roger!

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:25.070
- Draw!
 - Draw!

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:27.650
- I Summon Magnet Chameleon!
 - I Summon Magnet Chameleon!

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:32.990
Yuma Tsukumo!

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:40.500
When there's two Magnet Chameleons on the field, the opponent's Monster's effects are negated!

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:43.750
You can't use the effect of your Bull Blader anymore!

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:44.420
What!?

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:46.000
I won't let you!

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.420
Draw!

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:50.720
I Summon Heroic Challenger - Extra Sword!

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:55.100
I won't allow Yuma to be taken out by you people!

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.060
Coyote!

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:06.270
Shit!

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:10.990
You won't get away!

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:14.530
Yuma! He's <i>my</i> opponent!
 Let me do this!

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:15.450
Anna!

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:19.330
In that case, I'll lend you my strength!

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:23.870
This makes no sense! There may be three people here, but only one of us can battle him!

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:27.380
No, it may be possible if you're on the same lane.

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:27.750
Eh?

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:32.840
Yuma, you've got Bull Blader and Anna's got Trolleyrolley.

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:36.300
With Gauche's Extra Sword, they're all Level Fours.

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:39.060
If you've got three Level Four Monsters gathered...

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:41.060
An Xyz Summon!

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:44.310
That's right. It's time to join our hearts together.

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:45.440
Okay!

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:52.820
I Overlay my Level Four Bull Blader with Anna's Trolleyrolley and Gauche's Extra Sword!

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:58.990
I build the Overlay Network with these three Monsters!

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.740
Xyz Summon!

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:05.170
Show yourself, One-Eyed Skill Gainer!

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:15.300
2500 Attack Points?

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:20.060
Hmph! Hardly a threat to my 3500 Attack Power Magnedragon!

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:26.600
When Extra Sword becomes an Overlay Unit, its effect increases its Attack Power by 1000 points!

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:31.110
And my Trolleyrolley has an effect that increases its Attack Power by 800 points!

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:39.530
What the hell?! It's got 4300 Attack Points?!

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:42.290
Yuma, use its Monster Effect!

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:46.330
Right! I then activate Skill Gainer's Monster Effect!

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:51.800
By detaching one Overlay Unit, I can use the opponent's Monster's effect myself!

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:54.760
So I'll steal Magnedragon's effect!

00:17:58.220 --> 00:17:59.180
Not good...

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:06.310
My Magnedragon's effect deals the Attack Power of the Monster it destroys as damage to the opposing player!

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:08.940
I'll take 800 Battle Damage.

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:12.360
And if I take another 3500 points of Effect Damage...

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:15.650
I'll lose by a One Turn Kill...

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:19.620
Take this! This is the bond we share with our friends!

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:21.780
Like I'll let you!

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:23.540
What!?

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:28.170
I won't let my brother be taken down!

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:40.180
Jackal!!

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:48.730
So you ran away! See you!

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:51.560
Enough. We won.

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:54.520
Yeah, by working together.

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:00.660
<i>That was well done!</i>

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:03.280
<i>Contestant Tsukumo used the combined power of his friends</i>

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:07.540
<i>and managed to stop the three Fallguys trio and force them to retreat in defeat!</i>

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:09.080
They did it!

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:10.330
Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:11.960
He won! That was so cool!

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:16.130
Shit... Shit...! Shit!

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:20.130
They're unforgivable...

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:24.760
Huh? So you aren't one of the Tournament Finalists?

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:26.260
R-Right...

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:29.230
Goodness... Your spirit is outrageous.

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:34.270
You tied up one of the Tournament Finalists and switched places with them?!

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:36.150
Tokunosuke did the same thing...

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:37.690
I had no choice!

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:42.490
I mean... I wanted to meet you...

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:43.870
Huh? What's that?!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:50.040
Magnedragon! That guy came back!

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:55.710
I'm here to avenge Jackal and Coyote!

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.170
Yuma, this is bad!

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:01.220
I activate the Magic Card, Direct Magnet, from my hand!

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:03.550
I pay half of my Life...

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:09.390
...and halve my Monster's Attack Points in order to attack you directly!

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.520
Take this!!

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:16.270
No you don't!

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:21.820
I Special Summon Construction Train Signal Red!

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:28.910
When the enemy attacks directly, Signal Red can force the two to battle!

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:34.750
Anna!!

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:39.130
Anna...

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:43.590
That girl got in the way again!

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:46.970
This time will be a <i>genuine</i> Direct Attack!

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:49.810
Go, Skill Gainer!

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.940
Dark Blade!

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:07.320
<i>The loser of the Duel shall be ejected from the lane.</i>

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:15.750
You did it!

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:17.170
You did it, Yuma.

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:21.380
Thank you, Anna. It was thanks to you.

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:26.550
I have faith in you. Don't lose on me.

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:33.430
Later. You better get the championship!

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:40.190
Man, the mood's gettin' really good.

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:44.820
Friendship... Bonds... I see now.

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:48.030
So this is Yuma Tsukumo's power.

00:21:48.030 --> 00:21:53.290
<i>The fierce battles that unfolded here in the Park Section have now come to a close!</i>

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:59.040
<i>Those who broke through and qualified shall head toward the next obstacle; the Underground Section!</i>

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:02.130
I'm gonna do it! I'm definitely gonna win!

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:05.720
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:15.600
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:21.230
<i>Move on ahead, speeding up our throbbing beats</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:31.950
<i>Listen boys and girls, here's the secret to boys and girls like you</i>

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:36.200
<i>You're really just so spontaneous, wild as can be</i>

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:37.500
<i>I bet you didn't know?</i>

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:40.210
<i>You might be a handful, but what's wrong with that?</i>

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:42.840
<i>Be up to no good, but learn for real</i>

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:48.050
<i>Go the unpredictable route and shuffle your cards with a goal in mind</i>

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:53.390
<i>Whenever you feel like you've lost your way, just take a minute to close your eyes...</i>

00:22:53.470 --> 00:22:59.020
<i>Shout "stop!" with all you've got, and there's your boundary line.</i>

00:23:00.350 --> 00:23:05.480
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:10.990
<i>We won't just stop here, not when we don't want to have any regrets.</i>

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:16.240
<i>Even if we get hurt, we can't just hesitate now</i>

00:23:16.450 --> 00:23:21.830
<i>We won't just give up, not when our future's a lot brighter than our today</i>

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:27.090
<i>Seriousness... It'll only make us keep fighting even harder</i>

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:32.590
<i>We'll always get as fascinated as we want, and we'll fight on every day</i>

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:44.360
Now, the battle in the Underground Section Finals has finally started!

00:23:44.360 --> 00:23:47.360
Since everyone is busy battling, I'll go all out!

00:23:47.360 --> 00:23:50.030
But I can’t see anything in the darkness!

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:52.990
Yuma, the key is to find the troubled Duelists here!

00:23:52.990 --> 00:23:55.120
Whoa! A Trap Card?!

00:23:55.120 --> 00:23:58.080
Geez, what can you do with only 200 Life Points?

00:23:58.080 --> 00:24:00.410
What?! Gauche’s opponent…

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:01.120
That’s…

00:24:01.120 --> 00:24:03.580
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:03.580 --> 00:24:06.590
The Fated Rail: Try your Luck on a Trap Card?!

00:24:06.590 --> 00:24:09.210
Hey, wait!!
